Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-10-09 05:25:28 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
-----------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,520] | Words: 7  | Text: 今天我們聊別太老實
Segment #2   [00:00:01,1000 --> 00:00:03,160] | Words: 7  | Text: 千萬不要別人問什麼
Segment #3   [00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:04,400] | Words: 6  | Text: 你就老實回答什麼
Segment #4   [00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:07,200] | Words: 14 | Text: 許多時候這樣的習慣只會讓你陷入被動
Segment #5   [00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:08,320] | Words: 6  | Text: 甚至被人利用
Segment #6   [00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,660] | Words: 7  | Text: 找個安靜的角落
Segment #7   [00:00:09,660 --> 00:00:10,420] | Words: 4  | Text: 帶上耳機
Segment #8   [00:00:10,420 --> 00:00:11,500] | Words: 6  | Text: 輕聽這番內容
Segment #9   [00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,980] | Words: 16 | Text: 他能幫你認識到一種常見的思維陷阱
Segment #10  [00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:16,200] | Words: 12 | Text: 幫你避開日常生活中的許多坑
Segment #11  [00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,440] | Words: 6  | Text: 舉個簡單的例子
Segment #12  [00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,760] | Words: 7  | Text: 假設你是個大學生
Segment #13  [00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:21,060] | Words: 13 | Text: 原本只想從宿舍出門許多塊地
Segment #14  [00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:22,580] | Words: 7  | Text: 這是是有隨口問你
Segment #15  [00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:23,360] | Words: 4  | Text: 你去幹什麼
Segment #16  [00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:25,000] | Words: 6  | Text: 如果你下一時的回答
Segment #17  [00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:26,240] | Words: 5  | Text: 我去拿塊地
Segment #18  [00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:27,520] | Words: 6  | Text: 對方立刻計劃
Segment #19  [00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:28,800] | Words: 7  | Text: 正好我有六個塊地
Segment #20  [00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,900] | Words: 6  | Text: 麻煩你一起拿回來
Segment #21  [00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:30,440] | Words: 1  | Text: 你看
Segment #22  [00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,960] | Words: 9  | Text: 你原本只需做一件事
Segment #23  [00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:33,400] | Words: 8  | Text: 結果被別人的一句話
Segment #24  [00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,200] | Words: 6  | Text: 拖著多做六件
Segment #25  [00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,980] | Words: 7  | Text: 甚至可能因為不好意思拒絕
Segment #26  [00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:36,700] | Words: 5  | Text: 而默默接受
Segment #27  [00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:37,880] | Words: 6  | Text: 心裡卻不舒服
Segment #28  [00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:38,980] | Words: 4  | Text: 類似的情況
Segment #29  [00:00:38,980 --> 00:00:40,160] | Words: 8  | Text: 在職場上更為常見
Segment #30  [00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:41,100] | Words: 2  | Text: 比如說
Segment #31  [00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,060] | Words: 11 | Text: 領導突然關心其你的家庭情況
Segment #32  [00:00:43,060 --> 00:00:43,720] | Words: 2  | Text: 問你
Segment #33  [00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:44,320] | Words: 2  | Text: 小柳
Segment #34  [00:00:44,320 --> 00:00:45,840] | Words: 8  | Text: 你媳妇是做什麼工作的
Segment #35  [00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,060] | Words: 6  | Text: 你如果如是回答
Segment #36  [00:00:47,060 --> 00:00:48,220] | Words: 6  | Text: 他是個全職媽媽
Segment #37  [00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:49,100] | Words: 4  | Text: 再加代孩子
Segment #38  [00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:50,960] | Words: 9  | Text: 領導心裡可能立刻著墨
Segment #39  [00:00:50,960 --> 00:00:52,640] | Words: 9  | Text: 原來你家只有你一個人工作
Segment #40  [00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:53,460] | Words: 3  | Text: 這樣一來
Segment #41  [00:00:53,460 --> 00:00:54,180] | Words: 4  | Text: 在他眼中
Segment #42  [00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:54,820] | Words: 3  | Text: 你的壓力
Segment #43  [00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:55,640] | Words: 4  | Text: 承受能力
Segment #44  [00:00:55,640 --> 00:00:56,600] | Words: 4  | Text: 加班可能性
Segment #45  [00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,080] | Words: 9  | Text: 甚至生殖加薪的籌碼
Segment #46  [00:00:58,080 --> 00:00:59,340] | Words: 7  | Text: 都可能被重新評估
Segment #47  [00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:01,320] | Words: 9  | Text: 他更容易掌控你的工作節奏
Segment #48  [00:01:01,320 --> 00:01:02,880] | Words: 10 | Text: 也更方便安排額外任務
Segment #49  [00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:03,540] | Words: 4  | Text: 一想一想
Segment #50  [00:01:03,540 --> 00:01:05,200] | Words: 7  | Text: 我們從小到大的教育
Segment #51  [00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:05,920] | Words: 2  | Text: 很多時候
Segment #52  [00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,500] | Words: 10 | Text: 都在教我們提供標準答案
Segment #53  [00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:08,380] | Words: 2  | Text: 老師問
Segment #54  [00:01:08,380 --> 00:01:09,440] | Words: 5  | Text: 這道提選什麼
Segment #55  [00:01:09,440 --> 00:01:10,300] | Words: 3  | Text: 我們回答
Segment #56  [00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:10,780] | Words: 1  | Text: A
Segment #57  [00:01:11,240 --> 00:01:11,740] | Words: 2  | Text: 老師問
Segment #58  [00:01:11,740 --> 00:01:12,760] | Words: 4  | Text: 答案是多少
Segment #59  [00:01:13,260 --> 00:01:13,780] | Words: 2  | Text: 我們說
Segment #60  [00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:14,380] | Words: 1  | Text: 1000
Segment #61  [00:01:14,380 --> 00:01:16,260] | Words: 9  | Text: 好像每個問題都有固定解答
Segment #62  [00:01:16,260 --> 00:01:18,560] | Words: 13 | Text: 而我們只需準確無物的給出回應
Segment #63  [00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:19,120] | Words: 1  | Text: 另外
Segment #64  [00:01:19,120 --> 00:01:21,020] | Words: 11 | Text: 許多人的起門故事是狼來了
Segment #65  [00:01:21,020 --> 00:01:22,620] | Words: 8  | Text: 他強調城市的重要性
Segment #66  [00:01:22,620 --> 00:01:23,900] | Words: 8  | Text: 這兩種影響的結合
Segment #67  [00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:25,840] | Words: 13 | Text: 不知不覺讓我們養成了一種習慣
Segment #68  [00:01:25,840 --> 00:01:26,840] | Words: 4  | Text: 別人問什麼
Segment #69  [00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:27,820] | Words: 4  | Text: 我們就答什麼
Segment #70  [00:01:27,820 --> 00:01:28,660] | Words: 4  | Text: 從不猶豫
Segment #71  [00:01:28,660 --> 00:01:29,480] | Words: 4  | Text: 從不推敲
Segment #72  [00:01:29,860 --> 00:01:30,880] | Words: 6  | Text: 可是進入社會後
Segment #73  [00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:31,520] | Words: 3  | Text: 你會發現
Segment #74  [00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,400] | Words: 4  | Text: 大多數問題
Segment #75  [00:01:32,400 --> 00:01:33,540] | Words: 7  | Text: 並不需要具體答案
Segment #76  [00:01:33,540 --> 00:01:34,800] | Words: 6  | Text: 對方其實不在意
Segment #77  [00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:35,760] | Words: 8  | Text: 你回答的內容本身
Segment #78  [00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:37,380] | Words: 8  | Text: 而是想從你的回應中
Segment #79  [00:01:37,380 --> 00:01:38,320] | Words: 5  | Text: 解讀你的性格
Segment #80  [00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:38,920] | Words: 2  | Text: 處境
Segment #81  [00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:39,480] | Words: 2  | Text: 弱點
Segment #82  [00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:40,600] | Words: 6  | Text: 從而更好的影響
Segment #83  [00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:41,260] | Words: 3  | Text: 利用你
Segment #84  [00:01:41,260 --> 00:01:42,240] | Words: 5  | Text: 甚至掌控你
Segment #85  [00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:43,280] | Words: 5  | Text: 明白了這一點後
Segment #86  [00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:43,920] | Words: 2  | Text: 問題來了
Segment #87  [00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:45,420] | Words: 7  | Text: 對一些我們不想回答
Segment #88  [00:01:45,420 --> 00:01:46,240] | Words: 4  | Text: 或者可能帶來
Segment #89  [00:01:46,240 --> 00:01:47,100] | Words: 6  | Text: 負面影響的問題
Segment #90  [00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:48,020] | Words: 4  | Text: 應該如何處理
Segment #91  [00:01:48,360 --> 00:01:49,020] | Words: 3  | Text: 不用擔心
Segment #92  [00:01:49,020 --> 00:01:50,220] | Words: 7  | Text: 有三種使用方法
Segment #93  [00:01:50,220 --> 00:01:51,420] | Words: 8  | Text: 可以幫你記不傷和氣
Segment #94  [00:01:51,420 --> 00:01:52,940] | Words: 7  | Text: 又守住自己的邊界
Segment #95  [00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:54,160] | Words: 5  | Text: 第一種方法是
Segment #96  [00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:54,900] | Words: 4  | Text: 模糊回答
Segment #97  [00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:56,380] | Words: 8  | Text: 當別人問你去幹什麼
Segment #98  [00:01:56,380 --> 00:01:57,420] | Words: 6  | Text: 你不用詳細解釋
Segment #99  [00:01:57,420 --> 00:01:58,260] | Words: 3  | Text: 可以簡單說
Segment #100 [00:01:58,260 --> 00:01:59,120] | Words: 3  | Text: 我出去一下
Segment #101 [00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:00,460] | Words: 5  | Text: 如果對方追問
Segment #102 [00:02:00,460 --> 00:02:01,320] | Words: 4  | Text: 有什麼事嗎
Segment #103 [00:02:01,720 --> 00:02:02,660] | Words: 5  | Text: 你可以輕鬆回應
Segment #104 [00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:03,460] | Words: 2  | Text: 可能有
Segment #105 [00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:04,280] | Words: 3  | Text: 也可能沒有
Segment #106 [00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:05,100] | Words: 2  | Text: 看情況
Segment #107 [00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:07,000] | Words: 10 | Text: 這種方式不提供具體信息
Segment #108 [00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,020] | Words: 5  | Text: 即避免說謊
Segment #109 [00:02:08,020 --> 00:02:08,880] | Words: 5  | Text: 又防止對方
Segment #110 [00:02:08,880 --> 00:02:09,620] | Words: 5  | Text: 進一步挖掘
Segment #111 [00:02:09,620 --> 00:02:10,660] | Words: 4  | Text: 第二種方法
Segment #112 [00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:11,920] | Words: 7  | Text: 是巧妙轉一話題
Segment #113 [00:02:11,920 --> 00:02:13,080] | Words: 5  | Text: 比如領導問你
Segment #114 [00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,380] | Words: 7  | Text: 你愛人從事什麼工作
Segment #115 [00:02:14,380 --> 00:02:15,540] | Words: 5  | Text: 你可以笑著回應
Segment #116 [00:02:15,540 --> 00:02:16,880] | Words: 6  | Text: 怎麼突然關心這個
Segment #117 [00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:18,560] | Words: 10 | Text: 是要幫我媳婦介紹工作嗎
Segment #118 [00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:19,460] | Words: 3  | Text: 待遇怎麼樣
Segment #119 [00:02:19,460 --> 00:02:20,300] | Words: 3  | Text: 越新多少
Segment #120 [00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:21,540] | Words: 4  | Text: 通過反問
Segment #121 [00:02:21,540 --> 00:02:22,700] | Words: 6  | Text: 你把問題的焦點
Segment #122 [00:02:22,700 --> 00:02:23,640] | Words: 7  | Text: 轉移到對方身上
Segment #123 [00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:24,980] | Words: 7  | Text: 同時傳達了友好
Segment #124 [00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:25,720] | Words: 2  | Text: 但不過
Segment #125 [00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:26,720] | Words: 7  | Text: 與透露自己的信息
Segment #126 [00:02:26,720 --> 00:02:28,060] | Words: 6  | Text: 這樣做既不貌犯
Segment #127 [00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:29,340] | Words: 6  | Text: 又能守住隱私
Segment #128 [00:02:29,740 --> 00:02:30,620] | Words: 4  | Text: 第三種方法
Segment #129 [00:02:30,620 --> 00:02:31,500] | Words: 4  | Text: 是直接反問
Segment #130 [00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:33,080] | Words: 8  | Text: 面對那些並不重要的人
Segment #131 [00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,480] | Words: 10 | Text: 或者是明顯想套話的對象
Segment #132 [00:02:34,480 --> 00:02:35,480] | Words: 5  | Text: 你大可以反問
Segment #133 [00:02:35,480 --> 00:02:36,620] | Words: 6  | Text: 你問這個想幹什麼
Segment #134 [00:02:36,620 --> 00:02:37,500] | Words: 4  | Text: 你先猜猜
Segment #135 [00:02:37,500 --> 00:02:38,280] | Words: 2  | Text: 猜對了
Segment #136 [00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,100] | Words: 4  | Text: 我再告訴你
Segment #137 [00:02:39,700 --> 00:02:40,380] | Words: 3  | Text: 這種方式
Segment #138 [00:02:40,380 --> 00:02:41,360] | Words: 7  | Text: 幽默中帶著堅定
Segment #139 [00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,640] | Words: 7  | Text: 能有效阻止對方
Segment #140 [00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:43,200] | Words: 3  | Text: 繼續追問
Segment #141 [00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:43,900] | Words: 2  | Text: 總之
Segment #142 [00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:44,920] | Words: 6  | Text: 不必別人問什麼
Segment #143 [00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:45,740] | Words: 3  | Text: 你就答什麼
Segment #144 [00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:47,100] | Words: 6  | Text: 學會在溝通中
Segment #145 [00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:47,700] | Words: 4  | Text: 保持主動
Segment #146 [00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:49,020] | Words: 7  | Text: 記不清一暴露自己
Segment #147 [00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:50,400] | Words: 9  | Text: 也不清一被人帶節奏
Segment #148 [00:02:50,400 --> 00:02:51,640] | Words: 5  | Text: 社會複雜啊
Segment #149 [00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:52,320] | Words: 4  | Text: 人心難測
Segment #150 [00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:54,040] | Words: 9  | Text: 保護好自己的信息邊界
Segment #151 [00:02:54,040 --> 00:02:55,900] | Words: 12 | Text: 才能避免許多不必要的麻煩
Segment #152 [00:02:55,900 --> 00:02:56,940] | Words: 6  | Text: 無論是在職場
Segment #153 [00:02:56,940 --> 00:02:58,600] | Words: 7  | Text: 社交還是日常生活中
Segment #154 [00:02:58,600 --> 00:02:59,480] | Words: 5  | Text: 掌握這些技巧
Segment #155 [00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:00,080] | Words: 3  | Text: 能幫你
Segment #156 [00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:01,200] | Words: 7  | Text: 更好的處理人際關係
Segment #157 [00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:02,480] | Words: 7  | Text: 減少被動和壓力
Segment #158 [00:03:02,480 --> 00:03:03,440] | Words: 3  | Text: 從今天起
Segment #159 [00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,120] | Words: 4  | Text: 試著改變
Segment #160 [00:03:04,120 --> 00:03:05,300] | Words: 9  | Text: 一問一答的慣性思維
Segment #161 [00:03:05,300 --> 00:03:06,640] | Words: 7  | Text: 讓自己在研談之間
Segment #162 [00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:07,960] | Words: 7  | Text: 更加從容和智慧
Segment #163 [00:03:07,960 --> 00:03:08,460] | Words: 1  | Text: 好了
Segment #164 [00:03:08,460 --> 00:03:10,000] | Words: 7  | Text: 這裡是認知醒悟社
Segment #165 [00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:10,900] | Words: 2  | Text: 如果你覺得
Segment #166 [00:03:10,900 --> 00:03:12,180] | Words: 8  | Text: 這條視頻對你有幫助
Segment #167 [00:03:12,180 --> 00:03:13,240] | Words: 5  | Text: 請點贊關注
Segment #168 [00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,280] | Words: 4  | Text: 我們下期見
